WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.270
-As COVID cases continue
to climb,

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.506
GOP politicians are doubling
down on their opposition

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.340
to mask and vaccine mandates.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.343
On top of everything else,
the FDA has to warn people

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:13.679
not to take livestock dewormer.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:15.848
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:19.685 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:21.688
-COVID cases
are continuing to rise

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.723
and public health officials
are pleading with people

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.391
to get vaccinated
and wear a mask.

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:27.894
And yet, last night,
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis,

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.897
whose state has been recording
more daily cases on average

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:34.133
in the last few weeks than
anytime during the pandemic,

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:37.037
and who is against mask
and vaccine mandates,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.871
actually blamed
the Biden administration

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.206
for not ending COVID.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:43.876
-He said he was gonna end COVID.
He hasn't done that.

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:46.478
-It's quite a feat to be
the biggest [bleep] in Florida

00:00:46.478 --> 00:00:48.481
and not be from New York.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:51.151
Normally, it's the retired
New Yorkers creating problems.

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:54.320
One time I was buying board
shorts at a surf shop in Boca

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.355
and I overheard a guy yelling at
a cashier,

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.624
"You telling me it's 8 bucks
for a puka shell necklace

00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:00.626
when I could go down to the
beach and get 'em for free?

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:02.161
Get the [bleep] out of here."

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:04.664
That said, I think he ended up
buying the necklace.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.199
-Yeah, that's right. I did.

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:08.701
That gonna be a problem?

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.270
-No, not gonna be a problem.
I'm making an observation.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.239
-Okay. Good for you.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.408
Now do your little show.

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.944
-Okay, I will.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.412 --> 00:01:23.882
Shoemaker, will you walk me
to my car tonight?

00:01:23.882 --> 00:01:25.718
DeSantis really knows
how to boil your blood,

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:28.021
which is a bummer, because
Florida usually conjures up

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:30.189
feelings of vacation
and relaxation,

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:32.858
or the very least, you know,
gators on meth benders.

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:34.527
Their governor should be one of
those old guys

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.763
who grows a ponytail
to make up for going bald

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.664
and has a platinum membership
at Tommy Bahama,

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:41.166
but somehow they ended up with
this comic book henchman.

00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:42.668
Whenever this guy
says something,

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.337
it just brings out
the New Yorker in me.

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.105
I have the same reaction
to DeSantis that I do

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:47.941
when I see a guy
double-park his BMW

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.775
in a fire lane
outside a Duane Reade.

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:51.777
I'm just like,
"This [bleep] guy."

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:54.780
-I was just running in
for a Monster Energy.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.316
That's a problem?

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:57.816
-What?

00:01:57.816 --> 00:01:59.852
-I was double-parked
because I was running in

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:01.320
for a Monster Energy.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.823
Is that a problem?

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:07.826
-No, that's your right
as an American.

00:02:07.826 --> 00:02:10.930
[Quietly] Seriously, maybe bring
your pepper spray, too.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.365
Anyway, back to Ron DeSantis.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:14.533
You're blaming the federal
government for not ending COVID

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:17.469
when your state just passed
3 million cases,

00:02:17.469 --> 00:02:18.805
ICU's are filling up,

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:20.640
hospitals are fighting
to get oxygen.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.676
Instead of promoting mitigation
efforts we know can work,

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.512
like masks, you've actively
stood in the way of mandates --

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:27.713
even in schools.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.882
You can't just make us
forget about all that.

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:31.384
Those facts
are all public record.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.886
They don't just disappear
like sweet nothings

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:35.388
whispered in the summer wind.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.723
And, by the way,
those don't disappear either.

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:39.658
"You said you'd love me
till the end of time!"

00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:40.994
"Well, I didn't know
you were gonna

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.363
put wet towels on the bed!"

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.364
That's why Fox News exists,

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:47.566
to create an upside-down world
where nothing matters.

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:50.236
Not only do they exist
in a reality-free bubble,

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.738
but they don't even adhere
to their own internal logic.

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.873
One day, for example, when
they're pushing back

00:02:54.873 --> 00:02:57.109
against efforts to get
more people vaccinated,

00:02:57.109 --> 00:02:59.778
an anchor like Brian Kilmeade
will say something like this.

00:02:59.778 --> 00:03:02.514
-I don't think anchors should be
recommending medical advice.

00:03:02.514 --> 00:03:04.016
-Yeah. I agree.

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:06.852
-Well, you know, but a lot of
people have been tuning in

00:03:06.852 --> 00:03:08.855
to the show for 25 years
to see what we think

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:10.189
about different things.

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:12.692
I think if you have the
opportunity, get the shot.

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:15.527
-Right, but shouldn't you see
a doctor to give you expertise

00:03:15.527 --> 00:03:16.862
about what they're seeing?

00:03:16.862 --> 00:03:19.065
-You're a doctor, and that's
what people usually do --

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:21.734
they call their doctor
for medical advice.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.403
And that's what
people should be doing.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:26.272
Dr. Siegel, thanks so much.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.107
-Right, don't call
the president -- call me.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:29.608
You got it.
-Yeah, or anchors.

00:03:29.608 --> 00:03:31.611
We should just talk to doctors.

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:34.380
-I'm surprised Kilmeade is so
bullish on consulting doctors,

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.881
especially after
the way they botched

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:38.150
his eye-closening surgery.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.486
And they reveal themselves
as wealthy and out of touch

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.154
when they say something like,
"Call your doctor."

00:03:42.154 --> 00:03:43.623
This is America --
lots of people,

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:45.624
especially young and low-income
people, don't have doctors.

00:03:45.624 --> 00:03:46.826
You might as well say,

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:48.260
"If you want more information
on this story,

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.862
talk to the head butler
on your yacht."

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:52.865
Second, anchors, including
your co-host Steve Doocy --

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.200
and credit to him --

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.502
they aren't recommending
medical advice by telling you

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:59.004
about a lifesaving vaccine
during a deadly pandemic

00:03:59.004 --> 00:04:02.174
any more than "Hot Ones"
is recommending dietary advice

00:04:02.174 --> 00:04:04.009
by telling you to drink milk
with your wings.

00:04:04.009 --> 00:04:05.678
Which -- side note -- might help
with your mouth,

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:07.847
but it's an awful combination
for your stomach.

00:04:07.847 --> 00:04:10.349
I won't go into details, but
two days after I did that show,

00:04:10.349 --> 00:04:12.852
I was on WebMD
typing in the words,

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:15.487
"What do you do if you can't
stop [bleep] your pants?"

00:04:15.487 --> 00:04:17.155
Let's see.

00:04:17.155 --> 00:04:18.758
"Take off your pants"?

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:21.094
Well, that's not the help
I was hoping for.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.094
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.094 --> 00:04:23.429
And also -- side note --

00:04:23.429 --> 00:04:25.097
there's a lot of cursing
in today's "A Closer Look,"

00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:27.433
and that's because last night,
the Mets lost 3-2

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.769
to the Giants and dropped
to four games below .500.

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:31.771
They hit into five double plays.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:33.706
When I came in this morning,
our security guard Jim Breyer

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:35.675
was fully sobbing.

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:37.176
And he thought he was dying

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:39.511
because he had never
cried before.

00:04:39.511 --> 00:04:41.547
He didn't know what tears were.

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:43.582
He told me he didn't even go
home yesterday after the show.

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:45.384
He just rode the Long Island
Railroad all night

00:04:45.384 --> 00:04:47.052
drinking Natty Light tallboys.

00:04:47.052 --> 00:04:50.055
Apparently, they run a special
train just for that

00:04:50.055 --> 00:04:51.390
after the Mets lose,

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.895
and that train is now the
leading cause of global warming.

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:57.897
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.897 --> 00:04:59.432
-Anyway, the point is,
that's what Fox

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:01.367
and other right-wing figures
have often said

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.202
when the topic
of vaccines come up --

00:05:03.202 --> 00:05:06.038
don't listen to anchors or
politicians for medical advice.

00:05:06.038 --> 00:05:08.307
But then when they wanted
to promote

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:11.811
Regeneron's monoclonal antibody
treatment for COVID patients,

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:13.212
they had a slightly
different take.

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:16.549
-If you don't get vaccinated
and you go to the hospital,

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:18.784
most of the time,
you're going to get Regeneron.

00:05:18.784 --> 00:05:21.120
But Regeneron are
the antibodies,

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.489
so you're basically still
getting vaccinated be

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.791
'cause they're sticking you
with an antibody.

00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:29.195
-No, it's not the same
as getting vaccinated,

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.831
any more than getting
defibrillated is the same thing

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.199
as taking your heart medication.

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:36.335
Now, there's definitely evidence
that monoclonal antibodies

00:05:36.335 --> 00:05:39.171
can be effective, especially in
reducing severe disease,

00:05:39.171 --> 00:05:40.339
and that is great.

00:05:40.339 --> 00:05:43.008
But public officials have
stressed it's not a cure

00:05:43.008 --> 00:05:45.010
and it's not the way
out of the pandemic.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.680
As with any illness, it's much
better to prevent people

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.048
from getting sick
in the first place.

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:51.350
So telling people it's the same
as getting vaccinated

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.286
is deeply irresponsible, because
while Regeneron may work

00:05:54.286 --> 00:05:56.155
as a treatment,
safe and effective vaccines

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.490
that provide
tremendous protection

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.991
against severe disease and death

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:01.160
are abundant
and they're easy to get.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.296
You can walk into pharmacies,
health centers, mobile clinics,

00:06:04.296 --> 00:06:07.433
or megasites and get a shot
in like 20 minutes and be done.

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:09.769
Restaurants are offering them
with appetizers now.

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:11.103
The other day,
I went to a dinner party,

00:06:11.103 --> 00:06:13.772
and we ordered a round
of Pfizer shots for the table

00:06:13.772 --> 00:06:16.542
along with crab pfupfs
and chicken pfingers.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:20.046
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.982
Of course, this has been
the case on the right

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:24.483
since the start of the pandemic.

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:26.719
For some reason when it comes to
vaccines, they say things like,

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.553
"Don't listen to anchors
and politicians --

00:06:28.553 --> 00:06:29.721
talk to your doctor."

00:06:29.721 --> 00:06:31.757
But then they have
a very different take

00:06:31.757 --> 00:06:33.526
when it comes to unproven
treatments

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:36.528
like the antimalaria drug
hydroxychloroquine,

00:06:36.528 --> 00:06:38.864
or most recently
something called ivermectin.

00:06:38.864 --> 00:06:42.368
-We know that our FDA has
in many ways failed us

00:06:42.368 --> 00:06:45.404
by not allowing for the use
of ivermectin

00:06:45.404 --> 00:06:47.039
and hydroxychloroquine,

00:06:47.039 --> 00:06:48.874
both of which are used
around the world

00:06:48.874 --> 00:06:51.811
to reduce COVID hospitalizations
and deaths.

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:54.947
-They seem to keep saying
vaccination is the only answer,

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:56.315
the only answer.

00:06:56.315 --> 00:07:00.219
And we now know from studies
and also from the evidence

00:07:00.219 --> 00:07:02.888
that we saw of the use of
ivermectin in India

00:07:02.888 --> 00:07:04.724
that it does work.
-I don't know how many --

00:07:04.724 --> 00:07:06.726
100,000 lives
might have been saved

00:07:06.726 --> 00:07:10.396
if they had let the public
and doctors talk about

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:13.566
hydroxychloroquine and
ivermectin and prescribe it

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:16.035
without being called
by a pharmacist

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:18.037
as if they are doing
something illegal.

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:21.574
-This drug, ivermectin,
has been called,

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:23.709
at least by some doctors,
a miracle drug

00:07:23.709 --> 00:07:25.210
when it comes
to treating COVID-19.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.645
There's a good chance everyone
listening at home

00:07:26.645 --> 00:07:28.046
has never heard of ivermectin

00:07:28.046 --> 00:07:31.150
because Google has gone about
censoring any discussions,

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.486
including discussions inside the
halls of Congress

00:07:34.486 --> 00:07:35.621
about this drug

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:37.623
from their platforms,
including YouTube.

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.591
-My God, Fox News has
basically turned into

00:07:39.591 --> 00:07:41.360
one of those spam emails
promising you

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.195
free natural boner pills
for life.

00:07:43.195 --> 00:07:45.731
Anytime someone tries
to sell you a miracle drug

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:47.933
that "they" don't want
you to know about,

00:07:47.933 --> 00:07:49.401
you should be suspicious.

00:07:49.401 --> 00:07:52.572
That's how I end up with a case
of Mike Lindell's My Pills.

00:07:52.572 --> 00:07:55.407
They were supposed to help me
grow a full, luxuriant mustache,

00:07:55.407 --> 00:07:57.075
but I only ended up
with one or two of

00:07:57.075 --> 00:07:58.310
[Chicago accent] da hairs!

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.746
[Normal voice]
So, what exactly is ivermectin?

00:08:00.746 --> 00:08:02.682
-This is a deworming agent,

00:08:02.682 --> 00:08:04.683
a parasitic deworming agent
for livestock

00:08:04.683 --> 00:08:06.685
that has been used for years
and around the world.

00:08:06.685 --> 00:08:10.522
What is it chemically?

00:08:10.522 --> 00:08:13.025
-Yeah, so, you're talking about
an anti-infective

00:08:13.025 --> 00:08:15.794
that has been used
for a number of conditions --

00:08:15.794 --> 00:08:19.431
everything from skin conditions
to parasitic conditions.

00:08:19.431 --> 00:08:22.267
But again, this is
pharmaceutical grade,

00:08:22.267 --> 00:08:25.271
not livestock grade
that's being prescribed.

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:29.942
And we really are starting
to get these kind of crazy calls

00:08:29.942 --> 00:08:32.445
where people are now
playing doctor,

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:34.246
and this is very dangerous.

00:08:34.246 --> 00:08:36.281
-The Mississippi State
Department of Health

00:08:36.281 --> 00:08:40.820
confirming today that "at least
70% of the recent calls

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.322
to poison control in Mississippi

00:08:43.322 --> 00:08:45.157
have been related to ingestion

00:08:45.157 --> 00:08:48.861
of livestock or animal
formulations of ivermectin

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:51.363
purchased at
livestock supply centers."

00:08:51.363 --> 00:08:53.565
-I mean, you wouldn't
get your --

00:08:53.565 --> 00:08:58.237
treat your pneumonia with
your animal's medication.

00:08:58.237 --> 00:09:01.073
It can be dangerous to get the
wrong doses of medication,

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:03.242
especially for something that's
meant for a horse or a cow.

00:09:03.242 --> 00:09:04.710
-I got to say,
when I first heard

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.479
that Fox News
was pushing ivermectin,

00:09:06.479 --> 00:09:07.747
I knew it was gonna be bad,

00:09:07.747 --> 00:09:10.749
but I was not expecting it
to be horse dewormer.

00:09:10.749 --> 00:09:13.085
Sounds like the name of a drug
they give super soldiers

00:09:13.085 --> 00:09:15.588
in a Paul Verhoeven movie
to turn them into Robocops.

00:09:15.588 --> 00:09:17.590
You know someone at the company
that made ivermectin once said,

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:18.924
"Hey, should we put
'not for people'

00:09:18.924 --> 00:09:20.759
on the horse pill labels?"
and someone else said,

00:09:20.759 --> 00:09:22.928
"There's a picture of a horse
on the bottle!

00:09:22.928 --> 00:09:24.429
It's fine!"

00:09:24.429 --> 00:09:26.432
I mean, how does this [bleep]
keep getting dumber and dumber?

00:09:26.432 --> 00:09:28.467
First it was hydroxychloroquine,
then it was bleach,

00:09:28.467 --> 00:09:30.802
powerful lights,
now it's horse dewormer.

00:09:30.802 --> 00:09:33.105
I'm honestly terrified
to imagine what's next.

00:09:33.105 --> 00:09:35.006
One day we're going to wake up
and Brian Kilmeade is going to

00:09:35.006 --> 00:09:37.709
be telling people you can cure
COVID by eating kibble

00:09:37.709 --> 00:09:39.611
and sleeping
in a bed of kitty litter.

00:09:39.611 --> 00:09:42.615
"Works for me! That's why
I blink as often as a sphinx."

00:09:42.615 --> 00:09:45.284
Normally when you hear the
phrase "horse pills,"

00:09:45.284 --> 00:09:47.452
you think it's a euphemism,
but in this case,

00:09:47.452 --> 00:09:49.554
it's literal horse pills.

00:09:49.554 --> 00:09:51.957
Imagine getting that offer
in the bathroom at a club.

00:09:51.957 --> 00:09:54.126
"Hey, man, you want
to ride the stallion?"

00:09:54.126 --> 00:09:55.627
"Sure. What is it?"

00:09:55.627 --> 00:09:58.130
"Heart pills for a stallion."

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.999
Things have gotten so bad,
the WHO and Merck

00:10:00.999 --> 00:10:03.135
have warned against
using ivermectin.

00:10:03.135 --> 00:10:05.637
And this week, the FDA had to
issue a tweet saying

00:10:05.637 --> 00:10:07.306
"You are not a horse.
You are not a cow.

00:10:07.306 --> 00:10:09.308
Seriously, y'all. Stop it."

00:10:09.308 --> 00:10:12.044
There is no better indicator
of where we're at as a nation

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:15.347
that the face of the FDA
has resorted to "y'all."

00:10:15.347 --> 00:10:17.249
The juxtaposition of
anti-vaccine rhetoric

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:20.252
and scam artists pushing
an unproven livestock dewormer,

00:10:20.252 --> 00:10:22.254
is just so crazy.
In Texas, for example,

00:10:22.254 --> 00:10:24.422
the governor just banned
vaccine mandates

00:10:24.422 --> 00:10:27.459
even though the Pfizer vaccine
is now fully approved.

00:10:27.459 --> 00:10:30.629
At the same time, calls to Texas
poison control about ivermectin

00:10:30.629 --> 00:10:31.630
are soaring.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.132
There's been a 550% increase.

00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:34.467
On top of everything else now,

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.168
doctors have to deal
with this [bleep] too.

00:10:36.168 --> 00:10:37.669
Can you imagine
how exhausted they are?

00:10:37.669 --> 00:10:39.171
"Doc, I'm feeling a little" --

00:10:39.171 --> 00:10:41.240
"Did you take horse pills?"
"No, no, I didn't!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.575
Sorry, I gotta sneeze."

00:10:42.575 --> 00:10:44.076
[ Nickers ]

00:10:44.076 --> 00:10:48.713
[ Laughter ]

00:10:48.713 --> 00:10:50.882
"I did take horse pills."

00:10:50.882 --> 00:10:52.551
I mean, if you think
doctors are fed up,

00:10:52.551 --> 00:10:54.553
imagine how employees
at feed stores feel.

00:10:54.553 --> 00:10:56.255
Here's a report from local store
in Georgia

00:10:56.255 --> 00:10:58.256
where a reporter had to call
local feed stores to ask them

00:10:58.256 --> 00:11:01.927
about customers trying to buy
ivermectin for COVID.

00:11:01.927 --> 00:11:04.763
-Some folks are lining up for
the FDA-approved Pfizer vaccine.

00:11:04.763 --> 00:11:07.833
Others are trying a different
approach to fight COVID-19 --

00:11:07.833 --> 00:11:09.335
animal dewormer.

00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:10.836
-Never thought I'd have to do
an explainer

00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:13.172
on why people should not use
animal dewormer,

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:14.340
but here we are.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.007
Several feed stores
in central Georgia say

00:11:16.007 --> 00:11:18.443
they're sold out of the drug
called ivermectin.

00:11:18.443 --> 00:11:20.779
One employee at the
Tractor Supply in Byron told me

00:11:20.779 --> 00:11:23.282
they can't keep it on the
shelves over the last few days.

00:11:23.282 --> 00:11:24.950
I called over a dozen stores

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.119
until I found a small
mom-and-pop feed store.

00:11:27.119 --> 00:11:29.288
When I asked the employee if
they had it in stock,

00:11:29.288 --> 00:11:30.589
he said yes,

00:11:30.589 --> 00:11:32.758
but he asked, "Are you buying
this for an animal?

00:11:32.758 --> 00:11:35.427
Ma'am, please don't say
you're buying this for COVID."

00:11:35.427 --> 00:11:37.096
That's where we are right now.

00:11:37.096 --> 00:11:39.231
-You know who the real victims
are here?

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:41.533
The horses who can't get
their worm pills.

00:11:41.533 --> 00:11:43.368
Whoa, Smokey. Whoa.

00:11:43.368 --> 00:11:45.137
I got bad news, boy.

00:11:45.137 --> 00:11:47.572
I been to every feed store in
the state, but they're all out.

00:11:47.572 --> 00:11:49.008
I did get you a Pfizer vaccine.

00:11:49.008 --> 00:11:50.842
they were about to throw away
because it was gonna expire.

00:11:50.842 --> 00:11:52.177
Easy, boy!

00:11:52.177 --> 00:11:53.712
Easy, Smokey.

00:11:53.712 --> 00:11:55.714
[ Laughter ]

00:11:55.714 --> 00:11:57.550
We have a political coalition

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.752
fighting against mask
and vaccine mandates

00:11:59.752 --> 00:12:02.020
while also pushing
unproven miracle cures.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:03.689
This just proves yet again

00:12:03.689 --> 00:12:05.457
that you shouldn't get
medical information

00:12:05.457 --> 00:12:07.826
from right-wing media any more
than you should get it from --

00:12:07.826 --> 00:12:08.994
